    "With arrows, Home, End and ⌫ it stays Ctrl, since fn+← is Home and fn+⌫ is ⌦." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit Pfeilen, Pos1, Ende und ⌫ bleibt es Strg, denn fn+← ist Pos1 und fn+⌫ ist ⌦."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con flechas, Inicio, Fin y ⌫ sigue siendo Ctrl, porque fn+← es Inicio y fn+⌫ es ⌦."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avec les flèches, Début, Fin et ⌫, cela reste Ctrl, car fn+← est Début et fn+⌫ est ⌦."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "矢印キー、Home、End、⌫ との組み合わせは Ctrl のままです。fn+← は Home、fn+⌫ は ⌦ になるためです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "화살표, Home, End, ⌫와 함께일 때는 Ctrl을 유지합니다. fn+←는 Home이고 fn+⌫는 ⌦이기 때문입니다."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ze strzałkami, Home, End i ⌫ zostaje Ctrl, bo fn+← to Home, a fn+⌫ to ⌦."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Com setas, Home, End e ⌫ continua sendo Ctrl, pois fn+← é Home e fn+⌫ é ⌦."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配方向键、Home、End 和 ⌫ 的仍用 Ctrl，因为 fn+← 就是 Home，fn+⌫ 就是 ⌦。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "配方向鍵、Home、End 和 ⌫ 的仍用 Ctrl，因為 fn+← 就是 Home，fn+⌫ 就是 ⌦。"
          }
